Gentoo integration
==================

This package uses Python 3.12 and Portage-managed dependencies. The upstream
installer, uv, and pip are not required. Update Aider with Portage. In-app
upgrades and automatic installation of extras, Pandoc, and Playwright browsers
are disabled. Startup update checks are disabled by default; --check-update
still permits an explicit check.

The single-implementation LiteLLM, tokenizers, and Hugging Face Hub stack also
needs Python 3.12. Existing consumers using another Python target must be aligned
or run in a separate environment.

The package uses ::gentoo's grep-ast adapter and separately packaged
tree-sitter grammars. Repository-map tag extraction is available for C, C++,
JavaScript, and Python. Syntax parsing is limited to the grammars provided by
the adapter. Files in other languages can still be added and edited, but do
not receive the full upstream repository-map/linter parser coverage.

The upstream pip lockfile is replaced by a direct dependency list. In
particular, the NetworkX/SciPy limits for Python 3.10 and the importlib-metadata
limit used for release tooling are not applied to this Python 3.12 build.
LiteLLM is constrained to the version selected for this overlay package.

Ollama
------

Ollama is an independently administered service and may run on another host.
No model files are downloaded or installed by this package. For example:

    export OLLAMA_API_BASE=http://127.0.0.1:11434
    aider --model ollama_chat/<model>

See https://aider.chat/docs/llms/ollama.html for model configuration.

Optional integrations
---------------------

Optional modules are detected at runtime rather than selected by dependency-
pulling USE flags. Install their dependencies separately using Portage.

AWS Bedrock additionally requires dev-python/boto3, installed with Portage.

Voice input additionally needs the Python sounddevice and soundfile modules,
PortAudio and libsndfile. Formats other than WAV may also require FFmpeg.
Upstream's /voice command requires an OpenAI API key even when chat uses
Ollama. Browser mode needs Streamlit. Semantic /help needs the upstream
llama-index/Hugging Face embedding stack and model assets. These optional
stacks are not supplied by this ebuild; package availability must be checked
before use. Basic web scraping works without Playwright; Markdown conversion
uses virtual/pandoc, pulled in by the required pypandoc package.

Analytics retains upstream's opt-in behavior. Use --analytics-disable to
permanently disable telemetry, or --no-analytics for a single session.
